message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "UMSF Cyber-Range Digital Twin: Reproducible SIM Experiment, Synthetic Telemetry, and Provenance-Aware Verification Package"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible software package for a two-site cyber-range digital-twin
  prototype developed at the University of Customs and Finance, Ukraine.
  It contains the version 2.0.0 executable model and source code, scenario
  configurations, seed policy, tests, synthetic telemetry, scenario-generated
  ground truth, alerts, summaries, manifests, a limited design-of-experiments
  demonstration and a demonstration Monte Carlo workflow. All numerical outputs
  are synthetic results of the SIM-mode software model; the package contains no
  measurements of the physical cyber range.
